  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "<br>Welcome to The Journey Begins — your private beach retreat on 30A.<br><br>★ Pool heated extra seasons! March 1- May 1 and October 1- January 4. (weather pending) in 2026<br>★NEW 6-seat golf cart with GPS + sound system<br>★ Paddleboard included (with 4 life jackets) and 4 bikes with helmets<br>★ 2 community infinity pools with Gulf views<br>★ Pet-friendly (2 dogs under 50 lbs, pre-approved)<br>★ We personally self-manage — you get us, not a management company, which matters on 30 A! <br><br>LOCATION<br>The Journey Begins is in the gated Cypress Dunes community on the quiet west end of 30A, tucked between Topsail Hill Preserve State Park and the Gulf of Mexico. You’re minutes from beach access, dining, Grand Boulevard shopping, and the best of 30A. The home is just off 30A, so you can legally drive the golf cart on 30A to multiple beach accesses and restaurants.<br><br>OUTDOOR + COMMUNITY AMENITIES<br>• Stunning infinity-edge pool overlooking the Gulf<br>• Hot tub, fitness center, lounge seating, outdoor fireplace<br>• 2 resort-style pools, newly resurfaced tennis courts, and a newly updated gym! <br>• Access to rare coastal dune lake areas and walking trails<br>• Golf cart included for easy beach runs and exploring 30A<br>• Paddleboard AND 4 bikes included<br><br>THE HOUSE<br>Sleeps up to 12 total (including children). Perfect for multiple families, grandparents + kids, girls’ trips, or couples traveling together.<br><br>Sleeping Layout:<br>• Bedroom 1 (main level): King suite and premium mattress with blackout curtains<br>• Bedroom 2 (upper level): King suite and premium mattress with blackout blinds<br>• Bedroom 3 (upper level): King suite and premium mattress with blackout blinds<br>• Loft/bunk area: 4 twin bunks + TV hangout space for kids<br>• Queen sleeper sofa <br>• Additional: King Koil premium air mattress, gate for stairs, and pack-and-play<br><br>Bathrooms:<br>• Brand new master bath and upstairs bath fully renovated and completed 11/25! No expense spared! It's stunning! <br><br>INTERIOR<br>• 14’ ceilings on the main level, upscale coastal décor, and all-new designer furniture throughout<br>• Open-concept living/dining space made for gathering<br>• Fully stocked kitchen with stainless steel appliances, great counter space, and everything you need to cook, grill, or make snacks between beach trips<br>• Strong WiFi and multiple TVs<br><br>OUTDOOR LIVING AT THE HOUSE<br>• Screened-in porch with gas grill and comfortable seating <br>• Tin-roof covered porch with outdoor hanging bed<br>• Porch swings + multiple seating areas so your group can spread out<br>• Outdoor lounge areas, front and back porch (perfect spot for the slow mornings) <br><br>WHAT’S INCLUDED<br>We try to make beach days easy. At the house you’ll find:<br>• Beach chairs & umbrellas<br>• Cooler<br>• Ice maker<br>• Boogie boards & sand toys & towels & beach bags & beach cart <br>• Paddleboard (with life jackets sized for kids and adults)<br>• Golf cart access to nearby beaches — no loading cars and fighting for parking<br><br>DOG POLICY<br>We happily allow up to 2 dogs under 50 lbs if they are fully house-trained and approved in advance—pet fee: $200 per stay. Please message breeds at booking. (No puppies under 6 months or aggressive breeds.) Dogs must be crated or placed in the bathroom when unattended and are not allowed on beds or furniture.<br><br>POOL HEAT<br>The community pool is heated March 1- May 1 and October 1- January 4 (weather pending) in 2026! We cannot guarantee against temporary mechanical issues.<br><br>GOOD TO KNOW<br>• Quiet, upscale, family-focused neighborhood<br>• No parties, no events<br>• Primary renter must be 24+<br>• Max occupancy enforced<br>• We offer a return guest perk: refer a new weekly stay and get 10% off your next booking with us<br><br>You’re not renting an anonymous beach house run by a call center. We personally self-manage and care deeply about the details that make a stay special. Every touch reflects how we love to travel — comfortable luxury, ease, and thoughtfulness throughout.<br><br>Enjoy:<br><br>Ultra-comfortable beds with fresh linens, ceiling fans, and rotating floor fans in every bedroom<br><br>Fully stocked coffee bars with a Keurig, Nespresso, traditional coffee pot, grinder, and flavored syrups<br><br>Three outdoor living spaces — including a screened porch, hanging bed, and shaded patio seating — so everyone can relax or spread out<br><br>A cozy kids’ play nook and reading fort, giving little ones their own space while you unwind in the main living area with a book<br><br>From the layout to the small conveniences, everything is designed to feel personal, relaxing, and effortless — just like a true home away from home.<br><br>YOUR 30A PLAN<br>Take the golf cart to the beach. Paddleboard the rare dune lakes. Watch sunset from the infinity pool, looking out toward the Gulf. Grill on the screened porch. End the night on the hanging bed under the tin roof, listening to the breeze.<br><br>This is the place where the trip becomes a memory.<br><br>Book The Journey Begins and start yours today.<br><br>We take pride in offering true owner self-management. Unlike many rental companies on 30A that rely on third-party management—and are often slow to respond or unresponsive when issues arise—we personally handle every reservation, email, and phone call.<br><br>As the owners, we manage all guest communication directly, ensuring you are promptly and thoughtfully assisted with any questions or concerns before, during, or after your stay.<br><br>Our reviews consistently reflect how much guests appreciate our hands-on care, responsiveness, and personal attention—something you simply won’t get with most commercial managed properties on 30A.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
